{%- from "macros.njk" import steps, contact, ph with context %}
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="intro">
    <p class="mono eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>About CuSS</h1>
    <p class="lead measure">CuSS Custom Software Solutions is a small software business in Athlone, Co. Westmeath. We build the software, automation and websites that take the retyping out of running a small business, and we explain all of it in plain English.</p>
  </div>
  <section class="sec-tight" aria-labelledby="story-h">
    <h2 id="story-h">Who we are</h2>
    <div class="measure">
      <p>We work with small businesses: the ones where the owner still answers the phone, and a few hours saved every week makes a real difference. Most of what we do is joining up what’s already there, the spreadsheets, the inbox, the accounts package and the website, so information is typed once and goes where it needs to go.</p>
      <p>We keep it practical. Every job starts with a free call and a written plan with a price, before any work begins. We build in small steps so you see it working early, come to you when being in the room matters, and only suggest new software or subscriptions when they’re absolutely needed. What we build is yours: the code, the data and the accounts.</p>
      <p>We’re a small crew, and that’s on purpose. For bigger data and AI projects we bring in partners we’ve worked with and trust, and we stay your one point of contact. You’ve probably met CREW by now, too: he’s the robot who keeps things running round here.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sec-tight" aria-labelledby="why-h" data-crew-tip="Small crew. We pick up the phone.">
    <h2 id="why-h">Why CuSS</h2>
    <ul class="grid g4 plain">
      {%- for w in why %}
      <li class="info bv-lg">{% icon w.icon, "ci" %}<h3 class="h4">{{ w.t }}</h3><p>{{ w.d }}</p></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="sec-tight" aria-labelledby="how-h">
    <h2 id="how-h">How we work</h2>
    {{ steps(howSteps) }}
  </section>
  <section class="contact-sec sec-tight" aria-labelledby="contact-h">
    {{ contact('Tell us what you need') }}
  </section>
</div>
